/T (Zoho Creator is defined as a powerful low-code solution platform that uses AI assistance and low-code tools to create fully functional applications with minimum effort. Its characteristics include visual development, minimal coding, rapid development, AI assistance, cloud deployment, easy maintenance, and business-user friendliness. )
/E (Zoho Creator is defined as a powerful low-code solution platform that uses AI assistance and low-code tools to create fully functional applications with minimum effort. Its characteristics include visual development, minimal coding, rapid development, AI assistance, cloud deployment, easy maintenance, and business-user friendliness. )
