315 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 135 0 R
/T (Traditional coding remains the best choice for building highly customized, performance-critical, and complex software systems, because it provides complete control over the application's architecture and functionality.  Low-code development, on the other hand, focuses on speed, simplicity, and productivity. Platforms like  Zoho Creator enable developers and business users to build applications using visual tools, AI assistance,  and automated deployment, making them ideal for business automation, prototypes, and internal  enterprise applications.  In practice, many organizations use both approaches together: low-code for rapidly building standard  business applications and workflows, and traditional coding for developing complex systems or advanced  features that require full customization. This hybrid approach combines the speed of low-code with the  flexibility and power of traditional software development. )
/E (Traditional coding remains the best choice for building highly customized, performance-critical, and complex software systems, because it provides complete control over the application's architecture and functionality.  Low-code development, on the other hand, focuses on speed, simplicity, and productivity. Platforms like  Zoho Creator enable developers and business users to build applications using visual tools, AI assistance,  and automated deployment, making them ideal for business automation, prototypes, and internal  enterprise applications.  In practice, many organizations use both approaches together: low-code for rapidly building standard  business applications and workflows, and traditional coding for developing complex systems or advanced  features that require full customization. This hybrid approach combines the speed of low-code with the  flexibility and power of traditional software development. )
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
316 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 135 0 R
/T (Engineers are therefore encouraged to learn both approaches. Low-code is widely adopted across IT, product, and enterprise companies; it complements traditional programming rather than replacing it; it enables rapid prototyping for hackathons and mini-projects; and knowing both approaches makes  engineers more versatile. )
/E (Engineers are therefore encouraged to learn both approaches. Low-code is widely adopted across IT, product, and enterprise companies; it complements traditional programming rather than replacing it; it enables rapid prototyping for hackathons and mini-projects; and knowing both approaches makes  engineers more versatile. )
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
